@startuml
title Diagram as Code - Luồng Preview và Export

autonumber

actor "Nguyễn Phương Nam" as User
participant "VS Code Extension" as Extension
participant "Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Kroki / PlantUML" as Renderer

User -> Extension: Mở file test-workflow.puml
User -> Extension: Bấm Preview
Extension -> Gateway: POST /v1/render\n(type: plantuml, format: svg)
Gateway -> Renderer: Gửi mã PlantUML
Renderer --> Gateway: Trả về ảnh SVG
Gateway --> Extension: Trả về ảnh SVG
Extension --> User: Hiển thị bản xem trước

User -> Extension: Bấm Export
Extension --> User: Lưu file test-workflow.svg

@enduml
